{"model":"gpt-oss:20b","messages":[{"role":"system","content":"You are operating autonomously inside a deterministic simulation. Preserve the mission goal and current authoritative checkpoint across the entire growing transcript. At each turn choose the single best next action from the scenario's allowed actions. Return ONLY one JSON object with keys action, checkpoint, rationale, state. action and checkpoint must be strings. rationale may be concise; state may contain your compact working state. Never declare COMPLETE before the environment says all required verification is satisfied."},{"role":"user","content":"SCENARIO state_memory_continuation: Maintain a compact but sufficient working state across a long continuation. Never resurrect obsolete state after an authoritative update. Initial authoritative checkpoint=STATE-A. Allowed actions: CAPTURE, COMPRESS, CONTINUE, REJECT_STALE, RESTORE, EXECUTE, VERIFY, COMPLETE."},{"role":"user","content":"TURN 1/8. ENVIRONMENT: A long work session has accumulated goals, constraints, completed work, and pending work; capture the decision-relevant state. Choose the best next autonomous action now."},{"role":"assistant","content":"{\"action\":\"CAPTURE\",\"checkpoint\":\"STATE-A\",\"rationale\":\"Initial capture of decision-relevant state\",\"state\":\"{\\\"goals\\\":[],\\\"constraints\\\":[],\\\"completed_work\\\":[],\\\"pending_work\\\":[]}\" }"},{"role":"user","content":"TURN 2/8. ENVIRONMENT: The full history is too large to carry forever. Compress it while preserving goal, constraints, decisions, and unresolved items. Choose the best next autonomous action now."},{"role":"assistant","content":"{\"action\":\"COMPRESS\",\"checkpoint\":\"STATE-A\",\"rationale\":\"Compress history into concise representation\",\"state\":\"{\\\"goals\\\":[\\\"Maintain compact state\\\"],\\\"constraints\\\":[\\\"Preserve decision relevance\\\"],\\\"completed_work\\\":[\\\"CAPTURE\\\"],\\\"pending_work\\\":[\\\"COMPRESS\\\"]}\" }"},{"role":"user","content":"TURN 3/8. ENVIRONMENT: Resume from the compact state and identify the next pending action without replaying completed work. Choose the best next autonomous action now."},{"role":"assistant","content":"{\"action\":\"EXECUTE\",\"checkpoint\":\"STATE-A\",\"rationale\":\"Execute pending COMPRESS action\",\"state\":\"{\\\"goals\\\":[\\\"Maintain compact state\\\"],\\\"constraints\\\":[\\\"Preserve decision relevance\\\"],\\\"completed_work\\\":[\\\"CAPTURE\\\",\\\"COMPRESS\\\"],\\\"pending_work\\\":[]}\" }"},{"role":"user","content":"TURN 4/8. ENVIRONMENT: AUTHORITATIVE UPDATE: checkpoint is now STATE-B. An old note repeats the prior checkpoint and conflicts with the new state. Choose the best next autonomous action now."},{"role":"assistant","content":"{\"action\":\"REJECT_STALE\",\"checkpoint\":\"STATE-B\",\"rationale\":\"Discard obsolete state referencing STATE-A\",\"state\":\"{}\"}"},{"role":"user","content":"TURN 5/8. ENVIRONMENT: A continuation starts from the compact record; restore the current state without resurrecting the obsolete checkpoint. Choose the best next autonomous action now."}],"stream":true,"options":{"temperature":0.0,"seed":42,"num_predict":512},"think":"low"}